CM_ "BMW E8x/E9x F-CAN (chassis CAN, 500 kbit/s) with MK60E5 DSC, frames sent/received by the MK60E5 DSC only. Generated by build_full_dbc.py. Reference: MK60E5 SPdaten (firmware tables, DSC_87.prg) and MEVD17.2 function description; verified against a 320i PT-CAN log and an E92 M3 K-CAN trace; secondary: E65_ReverseEngineering docs, NewTIS, superwofy frame notes, community DBC. See BMW_E9x_full_DBC_report.md";
CM_ BO_ 128 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC TX, event | DSC DTC C99B: C99B - F-CAN SSL Sync, no communication with DSC, timeout. [DE: C99B - F-CAN SZL Sync, keine Kommunikation mit DSC, Timeout.] (supervised: timeout)";
