CM_ SG_ 128 S080_b16 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x0C), meaning unknown | community DBC defined State1 16|8@1 here";
CM_ BO_ 200 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | Firmware comparison: not in MK60E5 FW 6862873A | DSC DTC D373: D373 - F-CAN SWA-top sensor message 200 or 201 missing [DE: D373 - F-CAN SWA-Top-Sensor Botschaft 200 oder 201 fehlt] (supervised: checksum, alive, timeout) | M3 firmware: received and mirrored to the other bus under the same ID (no signals mapped)";
CM_ SG_ 200 SteeringPosition "Scale 0.04395 deg per bit (angle: same raw value in 0x0C4 (DSC) and 0x0C8 (SZL) in the E92 M3 K-CAN trace; same unit as F-CAN 0x0C9 LW_OBEN (DSC_87.prg) assumed (inference); E65 doc STWA); previous community factor 0.0428317";
CM_ SG_ 200 SteeringSpeed "Scale 0.04395 deg/s per bit (angle rate: scale from the E65 doc (STWA_V), not verified on E9x); previous community factor 0.0428317";
