CM_ BO_ 320 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | Sensor cluster identification: byte 0 = cluster type (DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TYP_SENSORCLUSTER, request 22 01 40)";
CM_ SG_ 320 S140_b0 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x04), meaning unknown | bits 0|8: CLUSTER_TYP - DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TYP_SENSORCLUSTER result STAT_CLUSTER_TYP_WERT (Typ des Sensorclusters); value table SGBD (1=Sensor Cluster VDO einfach; 2=Sensor Cluster SYSTRON DONNER einfach; 3=Sensor Cluster SYSTRON DONNER redundant; 255=Signal ungueltig)";
CM_ BO_ 404 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | Cruise-control stalk; DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TEMPOMAT_ACC decodes it with table TEMP_ACC (tip forward/back, push through, tip up/down, axial tip, mode button). Byte 2 (bits 16-23) is evaluated in priority order by BMW: 0xFF invalid; (b & 0x7F) == 0 no action; (b & 0xB0) == 0x10 tip down; (b & 0xB0) == 0x90 tip up; bit 6 axial tip; else low nibble 1 tip forward, 2 push forward, 4 tip back, 8 pull back (other values undefined) | E65 doc: 'Operation cruise control / ACC', DLC 4, cycle 200 ms | cycle time source: E65 doc";
CM_ SG_ 404 CHKSM_CCTR "BMW 8-bit checksum without ID: s = sum(other bytes) + 0; chk = (s & 0xFF) + (s >> 8) - verified 100 % in the 320i log and two E65 logs | previous name (community DBC): Checksum_404 | BMW name CHKSM_CCTR - E65 doc (HeinrichG-V12/E65_ReverseEngineering, Bosch MED9.2.1)";
CM_ SG_ 404 ALIV_CCTR "Message is sent at higher rate when cruise stalk is pressed | previous name (community DBC): Counter_404 | BMW name ALIV_CCTR - E65 doc (HeinrichG-V12/E65_ReverseEngineering, Bosch MED9.2.1)";
CM_ SG_ 404 OP_PUBU_CCTR_ACC "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x3F), meaning unknown | community DBC flags here: bit 16 = plus1mph_request, bit 17 = plus5mph_request, bit 18 = minus1mph_request, bit 19 = minus5mph_request, bit 20 = Cancel_request_up_or_down_stalk, bit 22 = Resume_request, bit 23 = Cancel_request_up_stalk | previous name (firmware field): S194_b16 | BMW name OP_PUBU_CCTR_ACC - E65 doc (HeinrichG-V12/E65_ReverseEngineering, Bosch MED9.2.1); one-hot enum; community DBC flags: bit 16 plus1mph, 17 plus5mph, 18 minus1mph, 19 minus5mph, 20 cancel, 22 resume | SGBD name TASTER_TEMPOMAT_ACC; DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TEMPOMAT_ACC result STAT_TASTER_TEMPOMAT_ACC (ACC_Status aus F_CAN Telegramm); value table SGBD";
CM_ SG_ 404 ABSTANDSWAHL_ACC "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x40), meaning unknown | previous name (firmware field): S194_b24 | DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TEMPOMAT_ACC result STAT_ABSTANDSWAHL_ACC (ACC_Status aus F_CAN Telegramm); value table SGBD";
CM_ SG_ 404 MODUS_WAHL_CC_CA "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3) signal (internal var 0x41), meaning unknown | previous name (firmware field): S194_b26 | DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_TEMPOMAT_ACC result STAT_MODUS_WAHL_CC_CA (ACC_Status aus F_CAN Telegramm); value table SGBD";
