CM_ BO_ 678 "MK60E5 FW 7846816A (M3): DSC RX | TIS: wiper switch position drives DSC brake-disc drying. DSC_87.prg job STATUS_F_CAN_WISCHERTASTER / table WISCHER (interval/auto, stage 1/2, tip wipe, front/rear wash, rear wipe, rain-sensor stage). Byte 0 is evaluated in priority order by BMW: 0xFF invalid; 0 no action; bit 7 rear wash; bit 6 rear wipe; bit 4 front wash; bit 3 tip wipe; else bits 0-1: 1 interval/auto, 2 stage 1, 3 stage 2 (bits 2 and 5 ignored)";
